WEBVTT

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.049
Press Option-Space,

00:00:05.049 --> 00:00:06.536
type a few letters,

00:00:06.536 --> 00:00:07.518
and press Return.

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:09.194
Ask a question,

00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:11.568
and it shows the passage and the page.

00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:13.729
It matches the words you use.

00:00:14.462 --> 00:00:16.943
Clipboard history keeps what you copy.

00:00:17.645 --> 00:00:19.771
It is off until you turn it on,

00:00:19.771 --> 00:00:21.537
and it skips password managers.

00:00:22.318 --> 00:00:23.334
Nine ninety-nine,

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:23.853
once,

00:00:23.853 --> 00:00:26.008
with a seven day free trial.

